}

<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col-12">
        <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
            <ol class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/crm">CRM</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Contacts</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Contact Management & Stakeholder Profiles</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Build meaningful relationships with the individuals who drive your customers' successes, 
            backed by a complete history of every conversation and engagement.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Individual Stakeholder Intelligence</h2>
        <p>
            Contacts provide the human dimension of your B2B relationships. Manage detailed profiles 
            that include role, professional background, decision-making influence, and personal 
            communication preferences. By mapping contacts directly to their sibling accounts, 
            the system ensure you understand the organizational landscape and the key 
            stakeholders who must be managed to drive successful outcomes.
        </p>
        <p>
            Social profile integration and professional detail fields allow for personalized 
            engagement, ensuring that your communication is always relevant and timely for 
            the individual recipient.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Unified Interaction Timeline</h2>
        <p>
            Experience a chronological view of every touchpoint with a specific individual. Whether 
            they opened a marketing email, replied to a WhatsApp message, attended a meeting, 
            or submitted a support ticket, all interactions are consolidated into one unified 
            timeline. This visibility allows sales representatives to walk into every 
            conversation with complete situational awareness.
        </p>
        <p>
            Communication preference management ensures you only reach out via the channels 
            preferred by the contact, maintaining professional boundaries and improving 
            overall engagement rates.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Hygiene and Data Integrity</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain the highest standards of data health with automated duplicate detection and 
            merging capabilities. Synchronize your contact list with integrated email and 
            calendar systems, ensuring that your CRM remains the authoritative source of 
            customer intelligence for the entire organization.
        </p>
        <p>
            GDPR and local data protection compliance features allow for the management of 
            opt-ins and communication consents at a granular level, protecting your organization 
            while ensuring that your outreach is always respectable and compliant.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
        <p class="small mb-0">
            <a href="/crm" class="text-decoration-none">← Back to CRM</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
